==Description==
Makeshift Storage, not to be confused with the [[Ship Components|Ship component]] [[Storage|storage]] solutions, are a craftable item which can be placed on island terrain, but not on assets or ships. They can also be placed inside island assets making them a great way to stash some loot on an island. Makeshift Storage can be crafted from the [[Gauntlet]] crafting menu. If empty, they will be destroyed on island resets but otherwise will remain.

